Wrote `coder-3.json` with one row for the `abortion` topic. All three sources trace to the same instrument, SB 1457 (2021), which Petersen co-sponsored and voted Yes on (16-14). Its provisions ban only sex/race/genetic-abnormality-motivated abortions and restrict abortions at public-school facilities — a different dimension than the ladder's gestational-stage question — so every passage codes `adjacent` at V2, and the row is `BLANK: no-evidence`.
